        "La rehabilitación física cuenta con el apoyo de proveedores con licencia enfocados en una atención segura y coordinada, y cada visita queda documentada en tu expediente médico.",
      ],
      image: "/images/professional-compassionate-primary-care.webp",
      imageAlt: "Proveedor escuchando a un paciente y revisando un plan de rehabilitación",
      hoursLabel: "Horario",
      hours: [
        { day: "Lunes - Viernes", time: "10 AM - 7 PM" },
        { day: "Sábado", time: "10 AM - 12 PM (con cita previa)" },
        { day: "Domingo", time: "Cerrado" },
      ],
      locationLabel: "Visítanos",
      address: "1004 W Linebaugh Ave Ste A\nTampa, FL 33612",
      supervisorLabel: "Supervisión médica",
    },
    transport: {
      title: "¿Necesitas transporte? Lo tenemos cubierto.",
      body: "Palm Wellness Center ofrece transporte gratuito de ida y vuelta a las citas para pacientes elegibles en toda el área de la Bahía de Tampa, para que llegar a tu evaluación nunca sea la razón para faltar. Solo pregúntalo al llamar o solicitar una cita.",
      image: "/images/patient-transportation-assistance.webp",
      imageAlt: "Miembro del personal ayudando a una paciente a bajar de un vehículo de transporte de cortesía en Tampa Bay",
    },
    faq: {
      heading: "Preguntas frecuentes",
      note: "¿Aún tienes preguntas? Llámanos al (813) 443-5370 y nuestro equipo te explicará tus opciones, cómo agendar y qué esperar en tu evaluación.",
      items: [
        { q: "¿Qué es la rehabilitación física?", a: "La rehabilitación física es un programa coordinado de recuperación enfocado en mejorar el movimiento, reducir el dolor, recuperar la fuerza, restaurar la movilidad y ayudarte a retomar tus actividades cotidianas después de una lesión, un accidente, una cirugía o una afección relacionada con la movilidad." },
        { q: "¿La rehabilitación física es lo mismo que la fisioterapia?", a: "La fisioterapia puede formar parte de la rehabilitación, pero la rehabilitación es más amplia. En Palm Wellness Center puede incluir ejercicios terapéuticos, atención quiropráctica, terapia de masajes, ultrasonido terapéutico, ejercicios de movilidad y apoyo médico coordinado según tus necesidades." },
        { q: "¿Qué tratamientos pueden incluirse en mi plan?", a: "Tu plan puede incluir atención quiropráctica, ejercicios terapéuticos, terapia de masajes, ultrasonido terapéutico, entrenamiento de movilidad, fortalecimiento, trabajo de flexibilidad y coordinación médica cuando corresponda." },
        { q: "¿Necesito una remisión para la rehabilitación física?", a: "Los requisitos de remisión dependen de tu plan de seguro y del tipo de atención que necesites. Nuestro equipo puede ayudarte a entender si necesitas una remisión antes de tu cita." },
        { q: "¿Cuánto tiempo dura la rehabilitación física?", a: "Cada recuperación es diferente. Tu proveedor recomendará un plan basado en tu condición, síntomas, objetivos y progreso durante la atención." },
        { q: "¿Puede ayudar la rehabilitación después de un accidente de auto?", a: "Sí. La rehabilitación puede ayudar después de un accidente de auto al mejorar la movilidad, reducir la rigidez, recuperar la fuerza y apoyar la recuperación de lesiones relacionadas con el accidente." },
        { q: "¿Puede ayudar la rehabilitación después de un resbalón o una caída?", a: "Sí. La rehabilitación puede ayudarte a recuperarte de dolor, rigidez, problemas de equilibrio, lesiones articulares o de tejidos blandos y movilidad reducida relacionados con una caída." },
        { q: "¿Cambiará mi plan de tratamiento a medida que mejore?", a: "Sí. Tu plan puede ajustarse a medida que mejoran el dolor, la fuerza, la movilidad, la flexibilidad y la función diaria." },
      ],
    },
    area: {
      eyebrow: "Área de Servicio",
      heading: "Sirviendo con orgullo a Tampa y sus vecindarios",
      lead: "Ubicados en el corazón de Tampa en 1004 W Linebaugh Ave, atendemos a pacientes de todo el condado de Hillsborough y comunidades cercanas.",
      places: ["Seminole Heights", "Forest Hills", "Carrollwood", "North Tampa", "Town 'N' Country", "Temple Terrace", "Brandon"],
      note: "Ofrecemos transporte gratuito para pacientes elegibles en toda la Bahía de Tampa, para que llegar a tu cita nunca sea la razón para faltar.",
      contactNote: "Transporte gratis para pacientes elegibles - pregúntalo al reservar.",
    },
    cta: {
      title: "Comienza tu rehabilitación en Tampa",
      lead: "El dolor, la rigidez o la movilidad limitada no tienen que ser tu normal. Solicita una evaluación y comienza un plan diseñado según tus metas.",
    },
    labels: { book: "Reservar cita", call: "(813) 443-5370", learn: "Ver más", onThisPage: "En esta página" },
  },
}[lang];

const bookAttrs = { target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" } as const;
const l = content.labels;

const backToTop = lang === "es" ? "Volver arriba" : "Back to top";

// Single hover language: a 2px lift plus ONE soft black shadow. It belongs to
// things the user can act on, or to the single card that fronts an action —
// never to both at once.
const hover = "hover-lift";

const eyebrowCls = "inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-pale px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-deep";
const eyebrowDarkCls = "inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-tint";
const h2Cls = "font-titles text-[26px] leading-[1.15] text-ink sm:text-[30px] lg:text-[34px]";
const leadCls = "text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-body sm:text-[17px]";
const btnBookCls = `inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-blue px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-deep ${hover}`;
const btnCallCls = `inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border-[1.5px] border-blue bg-white px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-blue hover:bg-blue-pale ${hover}`;
---

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-bg-alt">
  <div class="hero-ambient" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="hero-pulse"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="shell relative flex flex-col gap-10 pt-12 pb-26 lg:gap-12 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-32">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_560px] lg:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5">
        <span class={eyebrowCls}><Icon name="activity" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />{content.hero.eyebrow}</span>
        <h1 class="font-titles text-[32px] leading-[1.08] text-ink sm:text-[38px] lg:text-[46px]">{content.hero.title}</h1>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-[17px] leading-[1.6] text-body sm:text-[18px]">{content.hero.lead}</p>
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-3">
          {content.hero.chips.map((c) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="grid h-[30px] w-[30px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-blue-pale text-blue-deep"><Icon name={c.icon} class="h-4 w-4" /></span>
              <span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">{c.label}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5">
          <a href={APPOINTMENT_URL} {...bookAttrs} class={btnBookCls}><Icon name="calendar-check" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" />{l.book}</a>
          <a href={PHONE_TEL} class={btnCallCls}><Icon name="phone" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" />{l.call}</a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-muted">{content.hero.note}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-media-frame h-[280px] sm:h-[380px] lg:h-[440px]">
        <div class="hero-media">
          <img src={content.hero.image} width="560" height="440" alt={content.hero.imageAlt} fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="hero-media__img object-center" />
          <span class="hero-heart h-12 w-12 lg:h-14 lg:w-14" aria-hidden="true">
            <Icon name="heart-pulse" solid class="h-5 w-5 lg:h-6 lg:w-6" />
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dl class={`grid gap-8 rounded-lg border border-line bg-white px-7 py-7 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-10 ${hover}`}>
      {content.hero.rail.map((r) => (
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <dt class="font-titles text-[26px] font-bold leading-none text-blue-deep lg:text-[30px]">{r.value}</dt>
          <dd class="text-[13px] text-muted">{r.label}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ANCHOR NAV — in flow after the hero; sticks flush to the bottom edge of the
     sticky primary nav (header is 70px at lg, 64px below), so no gap appears. -->
<AnchorNav label={l.onThisPage} items={content.subnav} />

<!-- INTRO -->
<section id="what" class="scroll-mt-24 lg:scroll-mt-[184px] bg-white">
  <div class="shell grid items-start gap-10 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_480px] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
      <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.intro.heading}</h2>
      {content.intro.paras.map((p) => <p class="max-w-[68ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.62] text-body">{p}</p>)}
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-3.5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
      {content.intro.compare.map((c, i) => (
        <div class={i === 1
          ? `flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-deep p-7 ${hover}`
          : `flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-line bg-bg-alt p-7 ${hover}`}>
          <p class={i === 1 ? "text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-tint" : "text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-muted"}>{c.tag}</p>
          <p class={i === 1 ? "font-titles text-[30px] font-bold leading-none text-white" : "font-titles text-[30px] font-bold leading-none text-ink"}>{c.value}</p>
          <p class={i === 1 ? "text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-blue-tint" : "text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-body"}>{c.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CONDITIONS -->
<section id="conditions" class="scroll-mt-24 lg:scroll-mt-[184px] bg-bg-alt">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-10 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_420px] lg:items-end lg:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <span class={eyebrowCls}><Icon name="activity" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />{content.conditions.eyebrow}</span>
        <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.conditions.heading}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class={leadCls}>{content.conditions.lead}</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {content.conditions.items.map((c) => (
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6 lg:p-7">
          <span class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-md bg-blue-pale text-blue-deep"><Icon name={c.icon} class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
          <h3 class="font-titles text-[17px] leading-[1.25] text-ink sm:text-[18px]">{c.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.5] text-body">{c.body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROGRAMS -->
<section id="programs" class="scroll-mt-24 lg:scroll-mt-[184px] bg-white">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-10 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_420px] lg:items-end lg:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <span class={eyebrowCls}><Icon name="route" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />{content.programs.eyebrow}</span>
        <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.programs.heading}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class={leadCls}>{content.programs.lead}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {content.programs.items.map((p) => (
        <a href={p.href} class={`group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-white ${hover}`}>
          <img src={p.image} width="560" height="320" alt={p.imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-[200px] w-full object-cover sm:h-[240px]" />
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-7 lg:p-8">
            <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-md bg-blue-pale text-blue-deep"><Icon name={p.icon} class="h-[22px] w-[22px]" /></span>
            <h3 class="font-titles text-[20px] leading-[1.25] text-ink lg:text-[22px]">{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-body">{p.body}</p>
            <span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 text-[14px] font-bold text-blue">{l.learn}<Icon name="arrow" class="h-[15px] w-[15px] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" /></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="text-[14px] text-muted">
      {content.programs.note} <a href={content.programs.noteLink.href} class="font-semibold text-blue underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-deep hover:underline">{content.programs.noteLink.label}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TREATMENTS -->
<section id="treatments" class="scroll-mt-24 lg:scroll-mt-[184px] bg-bg-alt">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-10 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_420px] lg:items-end lg:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <span class={eyebrowCls}><Icon name="list-checks" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />{content.treatments.eyebrow}</span>
        <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.treatments.heading}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class={leadCls}>{content.treatments.lead}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {content.treatments.items.map((t) => (
        <a href={t.href} class={`group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-7 lg:p-8 ${hover}`}>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span class="grid h-12 w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-md bg-blue-pale text-blue-deep"><Icon name={t.icon} class="h-[22px] w-[22px]" /></span>
            <h3 class="font-titles text-[19px] leading-[1.25] text-ink lg:text-[20px]">{t.title}</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-body">{t.body}</p>
          <span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-[14px] font-bold text-blue">{l.learn}<Icon name="arrow" class="h-[15px] w-[15px] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" /></span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS (dark band) -->
<section id="process" class="scroll-mt-24 lg:scroll-mt-[184px] bg-blue-deep">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-9 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-4">
      <span class={eyebrowDarkCls}>{content.process.eyebrow}</span>
      <h2 class="font-titles text-[26px] leading-[1.15] text-white sm:text-[30px] lg:text-[34px]">{content.process.heading}</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-blue-tint sm:text-[17px]">{content.process.lead}</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {content.process.steps.map((s, i) => (
        <li class={`flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-7 lg:p-8 ${hover}`}>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-green-bright">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <h3 class="font-titles text-[19px] leading-[1.25] text-white lg:text-[20px]">{s.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-blue-tint">{s.body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY CHOOSE -->
<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-9 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex max-w-[800px] flex-col gap-4">
      <span class={eyebrowCls}>{content.why.eyebrow}</span>
      <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.why.heading}</h2>
      <p class={leadCls}>{content.why.lead}</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-9 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {content.why.items.map((it) => (
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <Icon name="badge-check" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-dark" />
          <h3 class="font-titles text-[18px] leading-[1.25] text-ink sm:text-[19px]">{it.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-body">{it.body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW TO GET STARTED -->
<section class="bg-bg-alt">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-9 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class={eyebrowCls}><Icon name="calendar-check" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />{content.start.eyebrow}</span>
      <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.start.heading}</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {content.start.items.map((s, i) => (
        <li class={`flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-7 lg:p-8 ${hover}`}>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-deep">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <h3 class="font-titles text-[18px] leading-[1.25] text-ink lg:text-[19px]">{s.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-body">{s.body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-muted">{content.start.note}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INTEGRATED (dark band) -->
<section class="bg-blue-deep">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col gap-9 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-4">
      <span class={eyebrowDarkCls}>{content.integrated.eyebrow}</span>
      <h2 class="font-titles text-[26px] leading-[1.15] text-white sm:text-[30px] lg:text-[34px]">{content.integrated.heading}</h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-blue-tint sm:text-[17px]">{content.integrated.lead}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-white/5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {content.integrated.items.map((s, i) => (
        <a href={s.href} class={`group flex flex-col gap-3.5 p-7 hover:bg-white/10 lg:p-8 ${hover} ${i > 0 ? "border-t border-white/15 sm:border-l sm:border-t-0" : ""}`}>
          <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-md bg-white/10 text-white"><Icon name={s.icon} class="h-[22px] w-[22px]" /></span>
          <h3 class="font-titles text-[19px] leading-[1.25] text-white sm:text-[20px]">{s.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-blue-tint">{s.body}</p>
          <span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 text-[14px] font-bold text-white">{l.learn}<Icon name="arrow" class="h-[15px] w-[15px] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" /></span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 pt-9">
      <p class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-tint">{content.integrated.relatedLabel}</p>
      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {content.integrated.related.map((r) => (
          <a href={r.href} class={`flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/15 ${hover}`}>
            {r.label}<Icon name="arrow" class="h-[15px] w-[15px] shrink-0" />
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST + HOURS -->
<section class="bg-bg-alt">
  <div class="shell grid gap-10 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_400px] lg:gap-14 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 class="font-titles text-[26px] leading-[1.15] text-ink sm:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px]">{content.trust.heading}</h2>
      {content.trust.paras.map((p) => <p class="max-w-[68ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.62] text-body">{p}</p>)}
      <img src={content.trust.image} width="560" height="320" alt={content.trust.imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mt-2 h-[240px] w-full rounded-lg object-cover object-top lg:h-[300px]" />
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
      <div class={`flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-7 ${hover}`}>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-deep">
          <Icon name="clock" class="h-4 w-4" />{content.trust.hoursLabel}
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col">
          {content.trust.hours.map((h, i) => (
            <li class={`flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 text-[15px] ${i > 0 ? "border-t border-line" : ""}`}>
              <span class="text-body">{h.day}</span>
              <span class="text-right font-semibold text-ink">{h.time}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class={`flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-lg bg-blue-deep p-7 ${hover}`}>
        <p class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-tint">{content.trust.locationLabel}</p>
        <p class="whitespace-pre-line text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.5] text-white">{content.trust.address}</p>
        <a href={PHONE_TEL} class="font-titles text-[22px] font-bold text-white underline-offset-4 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:text-blue-tint">{l.call}</a>
      </div>
      <div class={`flex flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-7 ${hover}`}>
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue">{content.trust.supervisorLabel}</p>
        <p class="font-titles text-[18px] font-bold text-ink">Dr. Arnaldo V. Orellana-Molina</p>
        <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-blue">{lang === "es" ? "MD - Médico Supervisor" : "MD - Supervising Physician"}</p>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-body">{lang === "es" ? "Brinda supervisión médica que mantiene cada plan seguro y alineado con las guías clínicas." : "Provides medical oversight that keeps every care plan safe and guideline-aligned."}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRANSPORT -->
<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="shell grid items-center gap-10 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[560px_1fr] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20">
    <img src={content.transport.image} width="560" height="400" alt={content.transport.imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-[240px] w-full rounded-lg object-cover sm:h-[320px] lg:h-[400px]" />
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5">
      <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.transport.title}</h2>
      <p class="max-w-[62ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-body sm:text-[17px]">{content.transport.body}</p>
      <a href={PHONE_TEL} class={btnBookCls}><Icon name="phone" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" />{l.call}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 lg:scroll-mt-[184px] bg-bg-alt">
  <div class="shell grid gap-10 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[400px_1fr] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class={eyebrowCls}>{lang === "es" ? "Preguntas" : "FAQ"}</span>
      <h2 class={h2Cls}>{content.faq.heading}</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-body">{content.faq.note}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      {content.faq.items.map((item, i) => (
        <details class={`group ${i > 0 ? "border-t border-line" : ""}`} {...(i === 0 ? { open: true } : {})}>
          <summary class="-mx-4 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-md px-4 py-5 text-[17px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <span>{item.q}</span>
            <Icon name="chevron-down" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-blue transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" />
          </summary>
          <p class="max-w-[62ch] pb-5 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-body">{item.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICE AREA -->
<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="shell grid gap-10 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_560px] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class={eyebrowCls}>{content.area.eyebrow}</span>
      <h2 class="font-titles text-[26px] leading-[1.15] text-ink sm:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px]">{content.area.heading}</h2>
      <p class="max-w-[60ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.62] text-body">{content.area.lead}</p>
      <p class="max-w-[60ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-muted">{content.area.note}</p>
    </div>
    <div class={`flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-lg border border-line bg-bg-alt p-7 lg:p-8 ${hover}`}>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
        {content.area.places.map((p) => (
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">
            <Icon name="map-pin" class="h-4 w-4 text-blue" />{p}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line pt-5">
        <Icon name="car" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-green-dark" />
        <p class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-body">{content.area.contactNote}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BACK TO TOP -->
<div class="bg-white">
  <div class="shell flex justify-end py-6">
    <a href="#main" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] font-semibold text-blue transition-colors hover:text-blue-deep">
      <Icon name="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 rotate-180" />{backToTop}
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="bg-blue-deep">
  <div class="shell flex flex-col items-center gap-4 py-16 text-center lg:py-18">
    <h2 class="max-w-[820px] font-titles text-[26px] leading-[1.15] text-white sm:text-[30px] lg:text-[34px]">{content.cta.title}</h2>
    <p class="max-w-[640px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-blue-tint sm:text-[17px]">{content.cta.lead}</p>
    <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href={APPOINTMENT_URL} {...bookAttrs} class={`inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-7 py-3.5 font-bold text-blue-deep hover:bg-blue-pale ${hover}`}>
        <Icon name="calendar-check" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" />{l.book}
      </a>
      <a href={PHONE_TEL} class={`inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border-[1.5px] border-blue-tint px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/10 ${hover}`}>
        <Icon name="phone" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]" />{l.call}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
